{%- comment -%}
The chapters of the Revised Section 508 Standards whose criteria rows
list, as a phrase: "chapter 5", "chapters 3, 5 and 6", or, when rows list
criteria of every one of chapters 3 to 6, "chapters 3 to 6". A chapter no
row lists is left out, so the report never claims a chapter its table
does not hold.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture chapters -%}
{%- for row in rows %} {{ row.criterion | slice: 0 }}{% endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign chapters = chapters | strip | split: " " | uniq | sort -%}
{%- if chapters.size == 4 -%}chapters 3 to 6
{%- else -%}
{%- if chapters.size > 1 %}chapters {% else %}chapter {% endif -%}
{%- render "list.liquid", items: chapters -%}
{%- endif -%}
